######
### Eerst token ophalen
POST http://localhost:8180/realms/keepdishesgoing/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id=backend-client&client_secret=NHhC580gogEpJ5K9fqsiyLiqF4VpqTKE&username=courier&password=password&grant_type=password&scope=openid

> {% client.global.set("access_token", response.body.access_token); %}

#####

GET http://localhost:7070/api/delivery/available
Accept: application/json

###Alles loopt juist
@id1 = 20a72e49-f5ad-4ee5-9728-ee3aa0e2d0d6

POST http://localhost:7070/api/delivery/{{id1}}/claim
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###Cancel order loopt juist
PUT localhost:7070/api/delivery/{{id1}}/claim/cancel
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###Ophalen token 2e courier
POST http://localhost:8180/realms/keepdishesgoing/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id=backend-client&client_secret=NHhC580gogEpJ5K9fqsiyLiqF4VpqTKE&username=courier&password=password&grant_type=password&scope=openid

> {% client.global.set("access_token2", response.body.access_token); %}

###Cancel order loopt fout; niet zijn delivery
PUT localhost:7070/api/delivery/{{id1}}/claim/cancel
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token2}}

### Delivery ophalen
POST http://localhost:7070/api/delivery/{{id1}}/pickup
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Complete delivery (uitbetaling berekenen + crediteren)
POST http://localhost:7070/api/delivery/{{id1}}/completeDelivery
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Haal lijst afgeronde deliveries en bijhorende betalingen op met doorlopend totaal
GET http://localhost:7070/api/delivery/completed
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Accept: application/json

###
POST http://localhost:7070/api/delivery/GetPayoutOverview
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

